    <string name="quick_setup_title">One-time setup</string>
    <string name="quick_setup_message">Fire OS hides accessibility switches for apps outside the Appstore, so the permission cannot be granted on the TV. Run these two commands once from a computer on the same network (ADB debugging must be on in Developer options). Lumora then turns quick actions and the Home button redirect on by itself, and keeps them on.</string>
