    <string name="home_redirect_hint">When the remote\'s Home button opens the Fire TV home, Lumora comes back to the front. Needs quick actions.</string>
    <string name="home_default_title">Default home on Fire TV</string>
    <string name="home_default_message">Fire OS always opens Amazon\'s home on the Home button and does not offer a home chooser. Lumora works around this with the quick-actions service: when the Fire TV home appears, Lumora returns. You may see the Fire TV home for a moment. Disabling the Amazon launcher over ADB is blocked on current Fire OS versions.</string>
